<command>
  <title>AllFactors</title>
  <short_description>All positive factors of a (small) positive integer</short_description>
  <syntax>
AllFactors(N: <type>INT</type>): <rtn>INT</rtn>
  </syntax>
<description>
This function produces a list of all positive factors of the positive
integer <tt>N</tt>; it is limited to "small" integers.
