This function returns the list of flats from the list <tt>A</tt> of hyperplanes
in the arrangement.
<example>
/**/ use QQ[x,y];	
/**/ A := [x, x-y, y];
/**/ ArrFlats(A);
[[ideal(0)],  [ideal(x),  ideal(x -y),  ideal(y)],  [ideal(x,  y)]]
</example>
</description>
<seealso>
