<command>
  <title>IsAtEOF</title>
  <short_description>checks if input stream has reached end of input</short_description>
<syntax>
IsAtEOF(in: <type>ISTREAM</type>): <rtn>BOOL</rtn>
</syntax>
<description>
This function tests whether the input stream <tt>in</tt> has reached end of input.
<example>
/**/  Istring := OpenIString("just one line");
/**/  GetLine(Istring);
just one line
/**/  IsAtEOF(Istring);
true
</example>
</description>
<seealso>
