<command>
  <title>IsPalindromic</title>
  <short_description>test whether a univariate polynomial is palindromic</short_description>
<syntax>
IsPalindromic(R: <type>RINGELEM</type>): <rtn>BOOL</rtn>
</syntax>
<description>
This function tests whether its argument (univariate poly) is palindromic.
<example>
/**/  use P ::= QQ[x,y];
/**/  IsPalindromic(x+1);
true
/**/  IsPalindromic(y^4-3*y^2+1);
true
/**/  IsPalindromic(x-1);
false
</example>
</description>
<seealso>
  <see>CyclotomicIndex, CyclotomicTest</see>
</seealso>
<types>
  <type>RINGELEM</type>
