<syntax>
IsStable(I: <type>IDEAL</type>): <rtn>BOOL</rtn>
</syntax>
<description>
This function tests whether the monomial ideal I is stable.
<example>
/**/  use R ::= QQ[x,y,z];
/**/  I := ideal(x*y^3, y^4, x^3, x^2*y, x^2*z);
/**/  IsStable(I);
true
</example>
</description>
