<command>
  <title>MultiArrToArr</title>
  <short_description>underling arrangement from a multiarrangement</short_description>
<syntax>
MultiArrToArr(MultiA: <type>LIST</type>): <rtn>LIST</rtn>
</syntax>
<description>
This function constructs the underling arrangement of the
multiarrangement MultiA.
<example>
/**/ use QQ[x,y,z];
/**/ MultiA := [[x,1], [y,3], [z,2]];
/**/ MultiArrToArr(MultiA);
[x,  y,  z]
</example>
</description>
<seealso>
