<command>
  <title>NmzSetVerbosityLevel</title>
  <short_description>Set the verbosity state for Normaliz</short_description>
<syntax>
NmzSetVerbosityLevel(v: <type>INT</type>)
</syntax>
<description>
Set the verbosity level for the external library Normaliz: level 0
means no <em>verbosity</em>, any positive value activates <em>verbosity</em>.
<par/>
NOTE: this is completely independent of the verbosity level for CoCoA.
<example>
/**/  NmzSetVerbosityLevel(1);
</example>
</description>
<keys>
