  <short_description>quit CoCoA</short_description>
<syntax>
quit
</syntax>
<description>
This command is used to quit CoCoA.  It may be used only at top level.
</description>
<seealso>
  <see>ciao</see>
  <see>exit</see>
</seealso>
<keys>
