<command>
  <title>RandomTupleIndices</title>
  <short_description>indices for random tuples</short_description>
<syntax>
RandomTupleIndices(N: <type>INT</type>, K: <type>INT</type>): <rtn>LIST</rtn>
</syntax>
<description>
The function returns a random tuple of <tt>1..N</tt> of
cardinality <tt>K</tt>.  See also <ttref>RandomTuple</ttref>.
<example>
/**/ RandomTupleIndices(32003, 10);
[4987, 13034, 10044, 7148, 11122, 1144, 21264, 5379, 2934, 7015]
</example>
