  <title>ReadExpr [OBSOLESCENT]</title>
  <short_description> [OBSOLESCENT] renamed RingElem</short_description>
<description>
[OBSOLESCENT]
from version 5.2.0 <ttref>RingElem</ttref> does the same, and more.
