<command>
  <title>SolomonTeraoIdeal</title>
  <short_description>Solomon-Terao ideal of an arrangement of hyperplanes wrt a poly</short_description>
<syntax>
SolomonTeraoIdeal(A: <type>LIST</type>, f: <type>RINGELEM</type>): <rtn>IDEAL</rtn>
</syntax>
<description>
This function returns the Solomon-Terao ideal of the list A of hyperplanes of an arrangement respect to a polynomial f.
<example>
/**/ use QQ[x,y];	
/**/ A := [x, y, x-y];
/**/ f := x^2+y^2;
/**/ SolomonTeraoIdeal(A, f);
ideal(2*x^2 +2*y^2,  2*x*y^2 -2*y^3)
</example>
</description>
