		and is thus untitled, the user will be prompted for a filename. If the docment
		is not untitled (and has thus been saved at least once before or has been loaded
		from a file) the old filename will be used.
	</td>
</tr>
<tr bgcolor=#EEEEEE>
	<td>&nbsp;</td>
	<td><b><a name="file_save_as">Save As</a></b></td>
