  PrintLn "            PrimaryHilbertSeries(I, Q);";
  PrintLn "    which computes the Hilbert-Poincare' series of (Q+I)/I,";
  PrintLn "    where (Q+I)/I is a primary ideal for M/I.";
  PrintLn "";
